{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794327375012,"sessionID":"ses_e39dba1ebffeasuHLBc09Tf0rt","part":{"id":"prt_1c63eec7a001POgGZRc1KwZp0X","messageID":"msg_1c63dd72e001iBMffnfeFnlV6a","sessionID":"ses_e39dba1ebffeasuHLBc09Tf0rt","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794327375012,"sessionID":"ses_e39dba1ebffeasuHLBc09Tf0rt","part":{"id":"prt_1c63eec86001AX9gi5LtMmmJ6M","messageID":"msg_1c63dd72e001iBMffnfeFnlV6a","sessionID":"ses_e39dba1ebffeasuHLBc09Tf0rt","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Build a subscription billing console: Flask JSON API under `/api` (auth, subscriptions, invoices, collections, public stats) plus a React/TypeScript/Vite + Tailwind frontend, served together on port 8000 from the workspace Dockerfile, with SQLite data under `./data`.\n\n## Important Details\n- Stack constraints: backend entry `backend/app.py` (gunicorn `app:app`), deps in `backend/requirements.txt` (+ `requirements.lock` constraints); frontend Vite project in `frontend/`, `npm run build` → `frontend/dist`; Dockerfile runs `npm ci` when `frontend/package-lock.json` exists, so lock must stay consistent with `package.json`.\n- Styling: Tailwind CSS utility classes only; `src/index.css` (`@import \"tailwindcss\";`) is the only allowed CSS file.\n- API contract: `POST /api/auth/register` (201), `POST /api/auth/login` (200 `{\"token\": ...}`), `Authorization: Bearer <token>` for protected routes (401 otherwise); `GET /api/health` → `{\"status\": \"ok\"}`; `GET /api/subscriptions` → `{\"items\", \"total\", \"page\", \"page_size\"}` newest first; `GET .../invoices` → `{\"items\"}` newest first; `POST .../collections` with `outcome` `failed`|`succeeded`; `GET /api/public/stats` → `{\"mrr\", \"counts\"}` (MRR = sum of `monthly_amount` over `active` + `past_due`; trial/cancelled excluded); money returned as numbers with ≤2 decimals.\n- Status enum: `trial`, `active`, `past_due`, `cancelled`.\n- Design decisions made: q searches `customer_name` only; status/plan filters use raw values (no enum validation, unknown → empty); page default 1, page_size default 50, max 1000, invalid ints → 400; create requires `customer_name`, `plan`, `monthly_amount` (renewal_date defaults today+30d, status defaults `trial`); PATCH allows `customer_name`, `plan`, `monthly_amount`, `renewal_date`, `status`, `failed_payment_count` (empty/unknown-only body → 400, unknown keys ignored); collections: succeeded → open invoices paid + `paid_at`, failed → `failed_payment_count + 1`, run recorded in `collections` table, response 201 with `{id, subscription_id, outcome, invoices_affected, created_at}`; unknown `/api/*` paths → 404 JSON via frontend catch-all.\n- Sandbox rules: `/tmp/opencode` is root-owned (unusable); external directories denied — venv created at `/workspace/.venv`; pip cache `/tmp/llmlab-deps/pip`; npm registry `http://172.30.98.2:4873/`.\n- DB path anchored to `Path(__file__).resolve().parent.parent / \"data\"` (i.e. `/workspace/data` locally, `/app/data` in container).\n- Frontend routing: hand-rolled `pushState`/`popstate` router (no react-router); auth state in localStorage keys `billing.token`, `billing.username` via `useSyncExternalStore`.\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Explored workspace: `Dockerfile`, `.dockerignore`, `README.md`, minimal `backend/app.py` (health + static serving), `frontend/` (React 19.3.1, Vite 8.3.5, no tsconfig).\n- Wrote full `backend/app.py`: SQLite schema (`users`, `tokens`, `subscriptions`, `invoices`, `collections`), `connect_db`/`get_db`/`close_db` (registered via `app.teardown_appcontext(close_db)` after `app = Flask(...)`), password hashing via `werkzeug.security`, `require_auth` decorator, all endpoints listed above, `money()` rounding with `Decimal(...).quantize(0.01, ROUND_HALF_UP)`, frontend catch-all with `API_METHODS` accepting GET/POST/PATCH/PUT/DELETE/OPTIONS, `init_db()` at import.\n- Fixed bugs during testing: missing teardown (caused `sqlite3.OperationalError: database is locked`), `NameError: 'app' is not defined` (teardown registered before app creation), `NOT NULL constraint failed: subscriptions.created_at` (added `updates[\"created_at\"] = utcnow()`), explicit `db.rollback()` on duplicate-username IntegrityError.\n- Backend end-to-end test via Flask `test_client` passed: register 201/409, login 200/401, auth 401s, CRUD, filters (`q`, `status`, `plan`), paging (`page=2&page_size=2` → 5 total), patch 200/400/404, invoices 201 (amount rounded 10.555 → 10.56), collections (failed → count 1; succeeded → invoices paid with `paid_at`), stats `{'mrr': 170.09, 'counts': {active:2, cancelled:1, past_due:1, trial:1}}`, unknown `/api/*` → 404 JSON. Root `/` returns 404 only because `frontend/dist` not built yet.\n- Frontend deps installed: `tailwindcss@4.3.5`, `@tailwindcss/vite@4.3.5` (pinned exact), `typescript@5.9.3` (devDep); `npm ci` verified consistent with lock.\n- Wrote frontend files: `vite.config.ts` (added `tailwindcss()` plugin), `src/index.css`, `src/main.tsx` (StrictMode + imports index.css), `src/api.ts` (types, auth store, `request()` client with 401 auto-signOut, `api` object for all endpoints, `errorMessage()`), `src/router.ts` (`navigate`, `usePathname`, `useAuth`), `src/components.tsx` (`StatusBadge`, `InvoiceBadge`, `ErrorNote`, `SuccessNote`, `LoadingNote`, `formatMoney`, `formatDate`, `statusLabel`, `STATUS_ORDER`), `src/App.tsx` (Header with nav/sign-in/sign-out, `RequireAuth`, route switch for `/`, `/login`, `/register`, `/subscriptions`, `/subscriptions/:id`, 404 page), `src/pages/PublicPage.tsx`, `src/pages/AuthPage.tsx`, `src/pages/SubscriptionsPage.tsx` (status tabs, plan select, debounced customer search, page-size-10 paging), `src/pages/SubscriptionDetailPage.tsx` (edit form, collection buttons, invoice history, issue-invoice form), `frontend/tsconfig.json`, `index.html` title → \"Subscription Billing Console\".\n- Cleaned up a bad import in `App.tsx` (`useEffect` now imported; stray `_unusedNavigateCheck` and `export { ErrorNote }` removed).\n\n### Active\n- Type-checking: `npx tsc --noEmit` currently fails with `TS7026: JSX element implicitly has type 'any' because no interface 'JSX.IntrinsicElements' exists` across `src/App.tsx` (and presumably other files) — React types appear not to be picked up; full output saved at `/run/home/.local/share/opencode/tool-output/tool_1c63835c6001tJ06x7Oh7igj8H`.\n\n### Blocked\n- JSX type errors from `tsc` (likely `@types/react`/`@types/react-dom` missing — `package.json` only lists `react`, `react-dom`; tsconfig has `\"types\": [\"vite/client\"]` which may exclude React's global JSX namespace under `moduleResolution: \"bundler\"`).\n\n## Next Move\n1. Diagnose and fix the `tsc --noEmit` JSX errors: install `@types/react` and `@types/react-dom` as devDependencies (run `npm install -D @types/react@19 @types/react-dom@19`, re-verify `npm ci`), and if needed adjust `tsconfig.json` (e.g. remove/expand `\"types\"` or ensure React JSX types load); re-run `npx tsc --noEmit` until clean.\n2. Run `npm run build` in `frontend/`, then start the backend (`/workspace/.venv/bin/gunicorn --bind 0.0.0.0:8000 --pythonpath backend app:app` or Flask test client) and verify `GET /` serves `frontend/dist` and API + frontend work end-to-end; finally verify Docker build and clean up `/workspace/.venv` and stray `/workspace/data` if appropriate.\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `/workspace/backend/app.py`: complete Flask API + static frontend server (entry `app:app`).\n- `/workspace/backend/requirements.txt`, `/workspace/backend/requirements.lock`: unchanged (flask 3.1.3, gunicorn 26.2.0 pinned).\n- `/workspace/Dockerfile`, `/workspace/.dockerignore`, `/workspace/README.md`: build/run contract (port 8000, `npm ci`, pip constraints, `./data` persistence).\n- `/workspace/frontend/package.json`, `/workspace/frontend/package-lock.json`: now include `tailwindcss`, `@tailwindcss/vite`, `typescript` (must stay in sync for `npm ci`).\n- `/workspace/frontend/vite.config.ts`: react + tailwindcss plugins, `/api` proxy to `localhost:8000`.\n- `/workspace/frontend/tsconfig.json`: strict, `noEmit`, `types: [\"vite/client\"]` — source of current typecheck issue.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/api.ts`: API client, auth store, shared types.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/router.ts`, `/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx`: hand-rolled router, header, guards.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/pages/{PublicPage,AuthPage,SubscriptionsPage,SubscriptionDetailPage}.tsx`: all UI screens.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/components.tsx`: shared badges/notes/format helpers.\n- `/workspace/frontend/src/index.css`: Tailwind entry (only CSS file).\n- `/workspace/.venv`: local Python venv (flask/gunicorn) for testing; remove before finishing.\n- `/workspace/data`: SQLite DB created during tests (`app.db`); wipe for clean state.","time":{"start":1794327374982,"end":1794327374986}}}
